flowchart TD
  SOURCE[Source manager: physical files, logical names and origins] --> DRIVER[source/driver.c: normal translation-unit pipeline]
  DRIVER --> FRONT[Tokens, typed AST and owned HIR]
  DRIVER --> IR[Verified IR before and after optimization]
  IR --> PASS[Actual optimizer CIR snapshots and pass records]
  DRIVER --> ALLOC[Selected MIR, physical allocation and CFG liveness]
  ALLOC --> GRAPH[CFG SVG from actual successor lists]
  DRIVER --> MACHINE[Original encoder: byte ranges and relocation records]
  FRONT --> CAPTURE[source/inspect.c: owned stage streams]
  IR --> CAPTURE
  PASS --> CAPTURE
  ALLOC --> CAPTURE
  GRAPH --> CAPTURE
  MACHINE --> CAPTURE
  SOURCE --> HTML[Atomic offline index.html]
  CAPTURE --> HTML
  HTML --> LINKS[Source, macro-origin and IR-to-machine fragment links]
